(Japanese: '''キミエ''' ''Kimie'') is a [[character of the day]] who appeared in ''[[EP228|Extreme Pokémon!]]''.

Kimie lives in the town of [[Eggseter]] with her husband [[Mr. Shellby]]. She was holding an {{p|Elekid}} {{pkmn|Egg}} when Mr. Shellby took {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} to their house at the Shellby Ranch. She was next seen speaking to {{an|Brock}} about [[Pokémon Breeding]] while Ash was practicing for the [[Extreme Pokémon Race]].

She hosted the race alongside Mr. Shellby. During the race, Kimie witnessed {{TRT}}'s balloon fall onto the ranch with {{TP|Gary|Arcanine}} freed from their net. After Ash defeated Team Rocket and won the race, Mr. Shellby rewarded Ash with a {{AP|Phanpy}} Egg, and Kimie and her husband waved Ash and his friends goodbye.

